# termcast.xyz tape. Source of the demo SVG in README.md (English).
# URL: https://termcast.xyz/t/v3/<base64url(deflateRaw(tape))>.svg
title PowerShell
theme dark
chrome mac
speed 38ms
hold 2600ms
prompt ❯
type irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bbjbc/seorap/main/install.ps1 | iex
wait 500ms
dim → checking latest release...
wait 300ms
dim → v0.1.3 · Seorap-Setup-0.1.3.exe (101 MB) downloading...
wait 900ms
ok ✓ SHA256 verified
dim → installing silently...
wait 800ms
ok ✓ installed: C:\Users\you\AppData\Local\Programs\Seorap\Seorap.exe
dim   Seorap is in your tray. Press Ctrl+Alt+V on anything.
wait 600ms
type
